  "v03_changes_vs_v02": [
    "skyline: sky band, broken rooflines, three hazed planes in brick / limestone / terracotta / glass; Woolworth-like piers (left), Municipal-Building-like colonnade (right), water tanks, one faint 2537 garden tower",
    "City Hall: per-window state table (blinds, curtains, lit, three reflection shapes), cornice shadow band, splash grime, 17 hand-placed rain streaks, deep-reveal shadows, Justice figure on the cupola, whole building and far stair hazed one aerial-perspective step; four door-scaled visitors on the stair",
    "trees: hand-cut crown gaps showing limbs, asymmetric lobe lists, SE plane forks low (V) with a low east bough, elm in vase form, back groves mirrored per instance with a spill lobe and hazed north of row 80",
    "lawns: new lawn-life layer (seated reader, picnic pair on a gingham blanket, bench reader, kneeling gardener, a small 2537 garden drone, three mounded shrub borders); seven mown patches break the tuft lattice",
    "flower beds: granite edging, mulch line, solid bloom drifts with lit caps and bloom ticks (v02 dots read dark)",
    "fountain: the tall 2-px jet is removed; two-tier centrepiece with a wide upper bowl, overflow veil (every 2nd column) and a low foam crown; the behind-fountain capture moves to stand directly behind it",
    "behind-tree capture moved 5 px west: trunk covers her east side, far foot and contact shadow visible",
    "gates: standing-on rule now counts a row against the heroine's own texels in that row (v02 counter could never exceed 0); contact-shadow gate accepts a behind capture whose front sprite covers >= 50 % of the footprint; native 640x360 windowed Godot render added beside 1280x720"
  ],
